codex
The interpreter is now explicit rather than axiomatizing the answer: it parses the emitted constructors, binds parameters in a map, evaluates conditions and expressions left-to-right, and performs recursive calls through an operational `call` term. I’m compiling this layer now and will adjust any K grammar/backend issues before adding proof lemmas.
